<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis Jesus the first and the last,</l><l>Who shall guide us through all to the throne;</l><l>We’ll praise Him for all that is past,</l><l>We’ll trust Him for all that’s to come.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
